  "instructions": [
    "Heat the score fat in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the ground cardamom and cinnamon and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the basmati rice and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add 4 cups of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork and stir in the cocoa powder and salt.",
    "Add the pitted dates and stir to combine.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
